ml-drift: handle 5D reshape/transpose attributes

Completes 5D (BHWDC) reshape/transpose support in ml-drift:

- add std::any_cast branches for Reshape3DAttributes and
  Transpose3DAttributes in the legacy GPUOperationFromNode selector;
- demote the 5D shape-mismatch warning in UpdateOutputTensors to VLOG(1)
  (known upstream axis-relabeling limitation, execution unaffected);
- skip 5D identity-reshape in RemoveIdentityReshape to avoid
  std::bad_any_cast.

Merges former patches 24, 25, 26.

diff --git a/ml_drift/common/selectors/operation_selector.cc b/ml_drift/common/selectors/operation_selector.cc
index a729d68..60302f2 100644
--- a/ml_drift/common/selectors/operation_selector.cc
+++ b/ml_drift/common/selectors/operation_selector.cc
@@ -1022,11 +1029,17 @@ absl::Status GPUOperationFromNode(const GpuInfo& gpu_info,
       return absl::OkStatus();
